{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちたんっ( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のおに魂聴いて下さった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふつおたなど、ラジオが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わった後読んだりしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん温かくて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっこりしますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本題に入りますが8枚目の選抜には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入ることは出来ませんでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、ふぁみたんが思ってる程"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち込んではないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりまだまだ選抜未経験者が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1期生にもいるのでその中の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま まあやが入ったことに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対する喜びのが大きくて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと2人ともアンダーメンバーが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜入りするのを7回も見てきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々感じたりすることがきっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は自分達がより多くの方に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魅せられる時がきたので思いっきり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"魅せてほしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"....あれ？あたし何だが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どの立場なの？笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーだけど1番近くで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支えられる応援者？っていうのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーいい言葉が当てはまらないや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしは成人式の取材で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『20歳になりましたがどんな大人に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりたいですか？』という質問に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「皆を引っ張っていける"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ような人になりたい。」と言いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".....あたしが引っ張ていくのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はアンダーメンバーです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜メンバーと同じくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーでも仕事量"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こなせるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人1人もっと輝けるように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして書くのが最後の方になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しまいましたがななの初センター♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しい(o´ω`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななは魅力溢れる人なので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周りの人も巻き込んでもっともっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい乃木坂を作れると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな大好き〜これからもよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/01/28/8361876/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","te